e criteria]\n- Task 2: ...\n\n### Phase 2: [Name]\n...\n\n## API Surface\n[Key endpoints, MCP tools, or CLI commands to implement]\n\n## Field Naming Conventions\n[From KAPPA_BUILD_PROMPT pattern — explicit field name rules]\n\n## Testing Requirements\n[What constitutes \"done\" for each phase]\n\n## Dependencies\n[Other [&] apps this depends on, and mock strategies when they're not available]"},{"id":"blk-18737","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-17168","text":"5) Cleanup Notes"}]},{"id":"blk-18738","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-17169","text":"The existing prompts are "},{"id":"spn-17170","marks":["bold"],"text":"not stale"},{"id":"spn-17171","text":" — they are current (March 2026) and technically precise. No cleanup needed on content. What would help:"}]},{"id":"blk-18739","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-18741","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-17172","marks":["bold"],"text":"Add frontmatter"},{"id":"spn-17173","text":" to each prompt (version, date, dependencies, target-app)"}]}],"id":"blk-18740","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-18743","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-17174","marks":["bold"],"text":"Cross-link"},{"id":"spn-17175","text":" prompts to their corresponding project_spec"}]}],"id":"blk-18742","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-18745","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-17176","marks":["bold"],"text":"Add milestone gates"},{"id":"spn-17177","text":" (\"what constitutes done\" per section)"}]}],"id":"blk-18744","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-18747","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-17178","marks":["bold"],"text":"Break ATTENTION_ENGINE_PROMPT"},{"id":"spn-17179","text":" (1,335 lines) into Codex-sized chunks if Codex context windows are a constraint"}]}],"id":"blk-18746","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-18748","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-17180","text":"6) Generation Workflow"}]},{"id":"blk-18749","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-17181"